OL,3,GNEWSAScepticism over UK-EU deal to ease
OL,4,AManx fishing pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's fishing industry
OL,7,Fcould benefit from a proposed UK-EU
OL,8,Fagreement to remove post-Brexit checks
OL,9,Fon food exports, while concerns remain
OL,10,Fover whether it will significantly
OL,11,Freduce costs for local businesses.
OL,13,FThe draft so-called sanitary and
OL,14,Fphytosanitary (SPS) agreement, expected
OL,15,Fto form a major part of the forthcoming
OL,16,FUK-EU summit, aims to cut red tape
OL,17,Fimposed on exporters after the UK
OL,18,Fexited the single market.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
