OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAScepticism over UK-EU deal to ease
OL,4,AManx fishing pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the Isle of Man, about 97% of
OL,7,Fcommercial fishing production is
OL,8,Fexported, predominantly to Europe via
OL,9,Fthe UK.
OL,11,FManx Fish Producers Organisation (MFPO)
OL,12,Fchief executive David Beard said he
OL,13,Ffeared that "once red tape is in, it's
OL,14,Fvery, very difficult to remove it
OL,15,Fagain".
